      "description": "Periodic full-frame detection with bounded local image tracking between refreshes.",
      "documentation": "<p>Wire Detector refresh cadence Image to any full-frame detector. Wire original Image, cadence Refresh and detector results here. Local LK similarity measurements refine existing identities only; only full detection discovers new objects. Blue means local evidence, green detector evidence, amber prediction. See docs/refresh-tracking.md for clock, budget, freshness and loss contracts.</p>",
